Output demo.webp
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 10

Type "source venv/bin/activate"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 1s
Type "clear"
Enter

Type "python3 scraper.py"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 15s

Type "python3 create_notebook.py"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "ls data/"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
